                                "sense_id": "6a59125c-7114-33ab-8f26-ffe8c564329a",
                                "text": "I've seen this child in her gymslip and school blouse […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1488fdb-d1d0-4567-9f59-da5c0d678265",
                                "sense_id": "6a59125c-7114-33ab-8f26-ffe8c564329a",
                                "text": "She'd swapped the print dress for a plain white blouse and brown gymslip."
                            },
