                                "sense_id": "6a59125c-7114-33ab-8f26-ffe8c564329a",
                                "text": "Boarders wore navy pleated skirts with white blouses; day girls had brown gymslips, cream blouses and beige jumpers. Lisle stockings could be a nuisance, as were hats and gloves."
